WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.100 --> 00:02.560
[Disclaimer: Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions,

3
00:02.580 --> 00:05.040
and events shown in the series are entirely fictional,

4
00:05.060 --> 00:07.520
solely for the purpose of entertainment, with no intention to instruct

5
00:07.540 --> 00:10.000
or promote any kind of behavior; viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:10.200 --> 00:12.480
Try wearing the day's lucky color.

7
00:14.390 --> 00:15.480
Dressed in all green, huh?

8
00:15.600 --> 00:17.920
Guess you won't need that inhaler anymore, huh?

9
00:18.160 --> 00:20.800
You can just get a desk lamp.

10
00:21.010 --> 00:23.240
It'll bring you luck in love.

11
00:23.350 --> 00:24.600
Can you guarantee that?

12
00:24.900 --> 00:27.000
You have my word as Xinxin, the feng shui master.

13
00:27.210 --> 00:28.360
You're still single, then?

14
00:28.510 --> 00:29.500
Hey...

15
00:29.520 --> 00:30.640
are you trying to fish for info?

16
00:30.790 --> 00:32.290
What do you think about...

17
00:32.700 --> 00:34.240
people who like the same sex?

18
00:34.330 --> 00:37.300
People just fall in love with someone.

19
00:37.990 --> 00:39.920
It's not a sin or anything.

20
00:42.640 --> 00:45.160
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

21
00:45.820 --> 00:48.410
You can contact the contractor for Mr. Mongkol's project now.

22
00:48.600 --> 00:49.400
Alright.

23
00:49.910 --> 00:51.450
- We closed the deal perfectly. - Exactly.

24
00:51.470 --> 00:52.890
Structural design and drafts

25
00:52.910 --> 00:54.310
have all been approved, no feng shui master needed.

26
00:55.410 --> 00:56.580
Well, we did rely on one.

27
00:57.410 --> 00:58.190
How so?

28
00:59.010 --> 01:02.080
I consulted Xinxin about the feng shui.

29
01:03.200 --> 01:03.790
What?

30
01:04.870 --> 01:05.390
But...

31
01:05.670 --> 01:07.280
you two were still fighting that day, weren't you?

32
01:07.500 --> 01:10.310
I thought you couldn't work on the same project anymore.

33
01:10.700 --> 01:13.320
Or has our architect finally opened up to the feng shui master?

34
01:13.510 --> 01:14.960
Aha...

35
01:16.010 --> 01:17.920
I just wanted to get this work done quickly.

36
01:18.180 --> 01:19.510
Opened up what?

37
01:19.530 --> 01:20.790
Who would believe in that kind of stuff?

38
01:20.820 --> 01:21.820
Such nonsense.

39
01:24.320 --> 01:25.520
- Oh? - What?

40
01:27.000 --> 01:28.390
- Let's go. - I'm lost.

41
01:28.600 --> 01:29.990
Don't forget to contact Mr. Mongkol, alright?

42
01:30.010 --> 01:30.680
Alright.

43
01:33.360 --> 01:33.970
[Sloth Sukiyaki]

44
01:33.990 --> 01:36.900
So, what should we have today?

45
01:37.710 --> 01:39.240
How about sukiyaki?

46
01:39.800 --> 01:41.400
That way, you'll actually eat some veggies.

47
01:42.510 --> 01:43.590
Mom!

48
01:43.610 --> 01:45.040
I do eat them, you know.

49
01:45.120 --> 01:47.290
You barely eat any, though.

50
01:47.310 --> 01:48.680
I eat some, though.

51
01:48.700 --> 01:49.410
Come on.

52
01:50.180 --> 01:50.900
This one, alright?

53
01:51.600 --> 01:53.120
Oh? Auntie Tai!

54
01:53.600 --> 01:54.730
Xinxin.

55
01:54.750 --> 01:56.130
Hello, Auntie Tai.

56
01:56.150 --> 01:57.920
- Hello. - Are you here to shop?

57
01:57.940 --> 01:58.890
That's right.

58
01:58.910 --> 02:00.660
I was bored, so I came out for a bit today.

59
02:00.680 --> 02:02.080
Soul is here, too.

60
02:02.100 --> 02:03.610
She'll be here in a minute.

61
02:03.630 --> 02:04.240
Oh.

62
02:04.980 --> 02:06.600
Uh, this is...

63
02:06.720 --> 02:08.020
Phing,

64
02:08.040 --> 02:09.080
my mom.

65
02:09.100 --> 02:10.510
And this is...

66
02:10.530 --> 02:11.620
Auntie Tai,

67
02:11.640 --> 02:12.610
Soul's mom.

68
02:12.630 --> 02:13.380
Oh...

69
02:13.410 --> 02:14.710
- Hello. - Hello.

70
02:14.730 --> 02:15.920
What did you just call me?

71
02:18.120 --> 02:19.120
Hello, Auntie Phing.

72
02:19.140 --> 02:20.810
Hi.

73
02:23.400 --> 02:24.890
Are you in a rush?

74
02:24.920 --> 02:26.650
Do you want to grab some food together?

75
02:26.670 --> 02:29.690
Actually, we were just about to go have sukiyaki.

76
02:29.710 --> 02:30.540
I see.

77
02:30.560 --> 02:33.370
That's great. We're looking for something to eat, too.

78
02:33.400 --> 02:36.270
Then please join us. I was thinking of having sukiyaki,

79
02:36.290 --> 02:38.410
since this one doesn't really eat vegetables.

80
02:38.430 --> 02:39.560
I see...

81
02:39.590 --> 02:42.120
Mine just loves to eat vegetables.

82
02:42.370 --> 02:44.430
I sometimes joke that she's like a cow

83
02:44.460 --> 02:46.360
- with a fridge full of veggies and grass. - Mom!

84
02:48.040 --> 02:48.590
Right.

85
02:48.610 --> 02:50.410
Then please join us, Ms. Tai.

86
02:50.430 --> 02:51.620
- Alright. - Be my guest.

87
02:51.640 --> 02:52.820
Thank you for letting us join, Ms. Phing.

88
02:52.840 --> 02:54.170
- It's my pleasure. - Right.

89
02:54.190 --> 02:55.780
- Come on, let's get inside, dear. - Let's go.

90
02:55.800 --> 02:56.830
Alright.

91
02:56.850 --> 02:58.920
She eats so few vegetables, so I thought...

92
02:59.410 --> 03:00.560
I don't think what you said

93
03:00.580 --> 03:02.030
worked out very well,

94
03:02.060 --> 03:03.540
since we've kept

95
03:03.560 --> 03:04.570
running into each other.

96
03:05.500 --> 03:07.990
I guess my energy is running low.

97
03:08.010 --> 03:09.820
I think it's time to make some merit.

98
04:47.310 --> 04:48.660
Make sure you eat plenty of vegetables,

99
04:48.680 --> 04:50.900
especially carrots, dear.

100
04:50.920 --> 04:53.670
Because they have vitamins that are good for your eyes.

101
04:53.690 --> 04:55.030
Since you're a feng shui master,

102
04:55.050 --> 04:57.510
you must use your eyes a lot, right?

103
04:58.180 --> 05:01.690
But I'm a feng shui master, not a rabbit, Mom.

104
05:01.820 --> 05:04.010
If you make me eat this much,

105
05:04.210 --> 05:06.110
I'll just dig a hole and live in it.

106
05:07.110 --> 05:08.420
They are just the same.

107
05:08.530 --> 05:10.810
Soul used to hate vegetables when she was little.

108
05:10.830 --> 05:12.640
I think when she was seven,

109
05:12.660 --> 05:16.510
she hid some broccoli under the couch

110
05:16.530 --> 05:19.050
and left it there until it rotted and smelled awful.

111
05:19.080 --> 05:21.640
It's a good thing her habits changed as she grew up.

112
05:22.710 --> 05:23.590
Mom.

113
05:23.610 --> 05:25.310
That was over 20 years ago.

114
05:25.330 --> 05:27.900
Why'd you say that? You're embarrassing me.

115
05:27.920 --> 05:29.240
It's true, though.

116
05:29.500 --> 05:31.590
I didn't know you had this in you.

117
05:31.610 --> 05:33.700
I thought you were a nerdy kid

118
05:33.720 --> 05:35.680
who'd been holding a steel ruler since day one.

119
05:38.400 --> 05:40.120
Hey, Ms. Tai.

120
05:40.310 --> 05:42.370
My girl is also something else.

121
05:42.390 --> 05:44.610
When she was around ten,

122
05:44.630 --> 05:47.350
- Right. - she started believing in horoscopes and stuff.

123
05:47.500 --> 05:50.210
We went to the temple to see a monk,

124
05:50.500 --> 05:53.320
and he said she'd have some bad luck.

125
05:53.610 --> 05:55.240
She really believed what he said,

126
05:55.260 --> 05:57.810
so she locked herself in a room for three whole days.

127
05:57.830 --> 06:00.980
I had to leave food and water outside her room.

128
06:01.000 --> 06:02.960
It was like having a kuman thong at home.

129
06:05.100 --> 06:07.680
That's called faith, Mom.

130
06:08.260 --> 06:10.280
I just followed the advice I got.

131
06:10.300 --> 06:11.880
Right, faith, you say.

132
06:11.900 --> 06:14.440
Alright, faith it is.

133
06:15.100 --> 06:16.370
Hey, Ms. Tai.

134
06:16.390 --> 06:18.400
Is Soul...

135
06:18.600 --> 06:20.290
dating anyone right now?

136
06:20.820 --> 06:21.620
Oh?

137
06:22.060 --> 06:23.520
She's single now.

138
06:24.110 --> 06:26.090
But when she loves someone,

139
06:26.320 --> 06:28.600
she puts all her cards on the table.

140
06:29.030 --> 06:30.060
Back then,

141
06:30.080 --> 06:33.440
she wanted to knit someone a scarf.

142
06:33.590 --> 06:36.490
She didn't even know how to knit, but she learned.

143
06:36.650 --> 06:37.730
And then

144
06:37.750 --> 06:39.600
she came back with a three-meter-long scarf.

145
06:39.620 --> 06:41.320
I thought it was a naga!

146
06:41.340 --> 06:42.150
Gosh!

147
06:42.170 --> 06:45.240
Was that meant to go around the neck or the whole body?

148
06:45.760 --> 06:46.800
Auntie Phing.

149
06:47.340 --> 06:48.780
Since Xinxin

150
06:49.040 --> 06:52.100
has believed in horoscopes and lucky colors since childhood,

151
06:52.120 --> 06:54.030
I wonder what color she wore

152
06:54.050 --> 06:55.680
for her university entrance exam.

153
06:57.130 --> 06:59.960
Vermilion was the lucky color that day.

154
07:00.500 --> 07:02.030
And guess what she did?

155
07:02.510 --> 07:04.160
Her undershirt was vermilion,

156
07:04.180 --> 07:06.700
so were her jacket and pants.

157
07:06.720 --> 07:08.100
Even her bow was in vermilion.

158
07:08.120 --> 07:10.460
But I think she was lucky the color of the day

159
07:10.480 --> 07:12.480
wasn't the three-colored spirit cloth.

160
07:12.500 --> 07:13.860
Otherwise, she'd become...

161
07:13.880 --> 07:16.210
a guardian spirit of that room.

162
07:16.900 --> 07:18.420
Mom!

163
07:18.440 --> 07:20.010
Actually, I have another story to tell.

164
07:20.030 --> 07:22.670
- About the wealth-attracting ritual. - Ugh, stop it!

165
07:23.190 --> 07:24.190
Moms,

166
07:24.690 --> 07:27.860
let's stop talking about our childhood antics for now,

167
07:27.880 --> 07:29.711
because this meatball is about to explode.

168
07:29.716 --> 07:30.960
This lava-filled one.

169
07:30.980 --> 07:32.290
- Come on, have some. - Let's dig in.

170
07:32.590 --> 07:33.780
I know you're hangry.

171
07:50.910 --> 07:52.440
You're only checking out my profile.

172
07:52.810 --> 07:54.500
I don't think that's fair.

173
07:55.000 --> 07:55.580
Uh...

174
08:01.050 --> 08:02.100
Your Instagram account.

175
08:03.100 --> 08:03.820
Alright.

176
08:09.920 --> 08:10.920
Here you go.

177
08:15.640 --> 08:16.520
[Following]

178
08:17.760 --> 08:19.510
[lada_stories_ started following you]

179
08:19.530 --> 08:20.660
[Follow back]

180
08:20.680 --> 08:22.000
[Following]

181
08:26.390 --> 08:28.120
I'm sorry I'm late.

182
08:28.710 --> 08:32.310
I got a little lost because I don't come around here very often.

183
08:32.900 --> 08:34.070
It's fine.

184
08:34.090 --> 08:36.200
I just got here.

185
08:37.690 --> 08:39.180
I ordered this for you.

186
08:39.310 --> 08:41.120
I thought you might be hungry.

187
08:41.600 --> 08:44.600
How did you know what I wanted?

188
08:46.200 --> 08:49.320
Well, you look mixed-race.

189
08:50.720 --> 08:52.600
Actually, I like Thai food.

190
08:55.060 --> 08:56.300
Uh, but...

191
08:56.940 --> 08:59.280
but I like what you ordered more.

192
09:01.600 --> 09:04.000
You almost gave me a heart attack.

193
09:04.820 --> 09:08.100
I actually guessed from looking at your lifestyle on Instagram.

194
09:09.590 --> 09:10.590
Thank you.

195
09:12.910 --> 09:16.560
How about we talk about work while we eat?

196
09:17.100 --> 09:18.240
I think we shouldn't.

197
09:18.500 --> 09:19.660
I'm free today,

198
09:20.800 --> 09:23.000
and my whole day is yours.

199
09:35.540 --> 09:36.990
What should we do now?

200
09:37.510 --> 09:40.700
It's gonna take hours for them to finish getting their nails done.

201
09:47.840 --> 09:48.720
Come with me.

202
09:54.620 --> 09:56.600
Where are you taking me?

203
10:01.880 --> 10:03.910
To get you a lamp, of course.

204
10:03.930 --> 10:06.100
I know you won't believe me.

205
10:06.320 --> 10:08.800
It's not like I want to be in love that much anyway.

206
10:10.180 --> 10:11.690
It wouldn't hurt, you know.

207
10:11.820 --> 10:13.800
So you won't be this stiff.

208
10:30.510 --> 10:31.890
I'll buy it for you.

209
10:31.910 --> 10:34.200
Consider it a good-luck charm from a feng shui master.

210
10:35.600 --> 10:36.360
I don't want it.

211
10:36.610 --> 10:38.110
I don't want to owe anyone.

212
10:39.610 --> 10:40.520
How much?

213
10:40.690 --> 10:41.920
I'll pay you back.

214
10:42.710 --> 10:43.300
Oh.

215
10:43.600 --> 10:45.160
How's Mr. Mongkol's project going?

216
10:45.280 --> 10:46.410
You haven't told me anything.

217
10:46.430 --> 10:47.760
Are you even listening?

218
10:47.980 --> 10:48.780
Heard it.

219
10:48.800 --> 10:49.620
Got it.

220
10:49.910 --> 10:51.820
So, how's the project?

221
10:52.540 --> 10:53.800
It's going well.

222
10:54.030 --> 10:55.560
Mr. Mongkol is happy with it.

223
10:56.100 --> 10:57.810
Thank you for your help.

224
10:58.960 --> 11:01.320
Then I should get something in return.

225
11:18.220 --> 11:20.100
Isn't this a bit modest of you?

226
11:23.100 --> 11:26.680
Honestly, I don't really need much in life.

227
11:26.900 --> 11:27.870
First,

228
11:27.900 --> 11:28.600
money.

229
11:29.190 --> 11:30.040
Second,

230
11:30.690 --> 11:32.280
sweets and delicious food.

231
11:40.400 --> 11:41.400
Don't you want some?

232
11:42.330 --> 11:43.210
No, I don't.

233
11:43.310 --> 11:44.710
I'm not a fan of sweets.

234
11:45.070 --> 11:45.920
Whoa...

235
11:46.790 --> 11:48.110
How boring of you.

236
11:50.660 --> 11:52.390
I just care about my health.

237
11:53.400 --> 11:54.120
Alright.

238
11:54.710 --> 11:55.310
Well...

239
11:55.970 --> 11:57.480
You don't eat sweets,

240
11:57.740 --> 11:59.880
you don't eat fried food,

241
11:59.900 --> 12:01.600
and even your light bulbs come in odd numbers.

242
12:02.320 --> 12:03.920
And a foul mouth...

243
12:04.890 --> 12:06.320
I mean, sharp-tongued.

244
12:06.610 --> 12:07.290
Mm.

245
12:07.310 --> 12:10.410
That's why love will never find you.

246
12:10.520 --> 12:11.900
It's only going to run away.

247
12:12.710 --> 12:15.600
Seriously, after everything you just said,

248
12:15.800 --> 12:18.120
would love ever come running to me?

249
12:19.310 --> 12:20.310
It would.

250
12:20.560 --> 12:22.600
And it's not coming slowly.

251
12:23.070 --> 12:24.670
It's running at pace one.

252
12:24.690 --> 12:26.220
You won't even see it coming.

253
12:53.100 --> 12:56.800
Is she afraid people won't know it's a love-boosting lamp?

254
13:17.520 --> 13:18.520
Excuse me, boss.

255
13:18.910 --> 13:20.200
I was tied up with a client just now.

256
13:20.510 --> 13:21.190
It's alright.

257
13:21.900 --> 13:22.900
Here, come on in.

258
13:27.220 --> 13:27.990
Alright.

259
13:28.100 --> 13:29.100
Shall we get started, then?

260
13:30.110 --> 13:32.360
Could you share what tasks you're currently working on?

261
13:32.670 --> 13:33.590
Let's start with Soul.

262
13:33.610 --> 13:36.400
I'm currently handling four projects.

263
13:36.610 --> 13:37.490
Mm...

264
13:37.510 --> 13:38.710
That's quite a lot to take on.

265
13:40.000 --> 13:40.760
What about you, Pat?

266
13:41.490 --> 13:42.910
I have two.

267
13:43.720 --> 13:44.630
Okay.

268
13:44.770 --> 13:46.800
Now we have a new project coming in.

269
13:47.210 --> 13:48.490
It's for Madam Waen,

270
13:48.510 --> 13:49.900
our regular client.

271
13:50.680 --> 13:53.520
She's planning to build a vacation home in Pran Buri.

272
13:53.690 --> 13:55.910
Actually, I'm thinking of assigning this project to Soul

273
13:56.680 --> 13:59.010
since you've worked with her before

274
13:59.030 --> 14:00.210
and probably know her well.

275
14:00.710 --> 14:02.510
But I've already mentioned to her that

276
14:02.820 --> 14:04.300
Soul might be busy.

277
14:05.020 --> 14:07.590
In that case, just assign it to Pat.

278
14:08.600 --> 14:09.950
You can handle this, right?

279
14:11.490 --> 14:13.451
Normally, I limit myself to three projects

280
14:13.463 --> 14:14.290
because...

281
14:14.720 --> 14:15.720
I...

282
14:16.040 --> 14:17.900
can't give them all enough attention.

283
14:19.100 --> 14:22.500
But if Soul can handle four projects this well...

284
14:23.400 --> 14:24.400
I guess I can take it on, then.

285
14:25.420 --> 14:26.420
Okay.

286
14:26.930 --> 14:28.690
So, your team will be responsible for

287
14:28.710 --> 14:30.020
Madam Waen's project, alright?

288
14:31.300 --> 14:33.710
But Madam is quite particular about feng shui,

289
14:34.010 --> 14:36.490
so you might have to work closely with the feng shui master.

290
14:37.130 --> 14:38.500
Mm... I'm alright with that.

291
14:39.120 --> 14:40.900
Who is that feng shui master, by the way?

292
14:41.200 --> 14:42.200
I might know them.

293
14:43.310 --> 14:44.750
It's probably the same one.

294
14:45.810 --> 14:47.400
She has her own feng shui master.

295
14:48.220 --> 14:49.070
Boss,

296
14:49.090 --> 14:51.120
could you assign me to this project?

297
14:53.000 --> 14:54.120
Are you sure?

298
14:54.790 --> 14:56.850
You already have too much work. I don't think you can manage.

299
14:57.910 --> 14:59.010
I can do it.

300
15:01.000 --> 15:03.120
With the team leader being this stubborn,

301
15:03.250 --> 15:05.190
if the client ends up complaining,

302
15:05.500 --> 15:06.850
we'll all be in trouble.

303
15:08.620 --> 15:11.100
That has never happened to me,

304
15:11.600 --> 15:13.100
and it never will.

305
15:21.900 --> 15:23.110
Is Miss Architect in charge

306
15:23.130 --> 15:25.010
of this project, Madam Waen?

307
15:25.390 --> 15:26.510
Yes, she is.

308
15:26.530 --> 15:29.900
At first, the company was gonna send some handsome guy.

309
15:29.920 --> 15:31.900
But I don't know what she was thinking.

310
15:31.920 --> 15:33.880
In the room, she offered

311
15:34.020 --> 15:36.090
to have her team take on this project.

312
15:36.110 --> 15:39.910
I think she might want to work with you.

313
15:40.290 --> 15:42.090
Does she want to work with me,

314
15:42.110 --> 15:44.300
or is she just messing with my head?

315
15:44.700 --> 15:46.420
Oh, come on...

316
15:46.440 --> 15:47.700
Trust me,

317
15:47.720 --> 15:49.320
my dear feng shui master.

318
15:49.420 --> 15:53.050
You two have great chemistry when you work together.

319
15:53.190 --> 15:54.100
I can feel

320
15:54.120 --> 15:57.420
the energy whenever you argue.

321
15:57.440 --> 15:59.910
It really livens up my house.

322
16:00.490 --> 16:02.450
Maybe it's spiteful energy?

323
16:02.480 --> 16:03.170
Oh, come on...

324
16:03.396 --> 16:05.646
Whatever that energy is,

325
16:05.670 --> 16:06.711
the deposit has already been transferred

326
16:06.933 --> 16:09.686
to the company.

327
16:09.711 --> 16:13.570
I hope you two will nail this project.

328
16:13.590 --> 16:17.590
Because I believe in both Xinxin, the feng shui master, and Ms. Soul.

329
16:19.000 --> 16:19.690
Alright.

330
16:23.420 --> 16:25.500
Gotta pray for good fortune ASAP.

331
16:29.210 --> 16:31.600
What will my relationship with her be like?

332
16:35.100 --> 16:37.520
[THE LOVERS]

333
16:40.560 --> 16:42.190
Oh, no way...

334
16:47.890 --> 16:49.000
Soul...

335
16:49.020 --> 16:51.050
I've already taken it. What can I do?

336
16:51.070 --> 16:54.510
I thought you said Madam Waen's project traumatized you.

337
16:54.530 --> 16:56.600
Why did you take on another project for her?

338
16:56.620 --> 16:57.670
She's right.

339
16:57.780 --> 16:59.920
Both Madam Waen and that feng shui lady.

340
16:59.940 --> 17:01.610
You can't stand either of them.

341
17:01.630 --> 17:03.040
Then why did you do this?

342
17:03.200 --> 17:04.310
Go ahead, yell at me.

343
17:04.330 --> 17:06.080
Don't hold back.

344
17:06.100 --> 17:07.360
Oh, we won't.

345
17:07.380 --> 17:08.340
You'd just yell back at us!

346
17:08.860 --> 17:11.230
But you have to tell us your plan

347
17:11.450 --> 17:13.940
- and how you intend to handle it. - Yeah.

348
17:13.960 --> 17:16.000
Or do you just want to pick a fight with Pat?

349
17:16.140 --> 17:16.610
Uh...

350
17:17.080 --> 17:17.720
Well...

351
17:18.200 --> 17:20.100
Pat was getting on my nerves first.

352
17:20.190 --> 17:22.070
He said I couldn't handle the projects.

353
17:22.090 --> 17:24.390
How could I just let him talk down to me like that?

354
17:24.410 --> 17:25.110
Mm...

355
17:25.920 --> 17:26.920
I get it now.

356
17:26.940 --> 17:28.300
It was Pat, right?

357
17:28.590 --> 17:29.210
Okay.

358
17:29.400 --> 17:30.840
How could he do this to us?

359
17:30.870 --> 17:33.460
We need to start a war over this.

360
17:33.480 --> 17:34.490
We'd better show them

361
17:34.510 --> 17:37.010
that our team is the best in the company!

362
17:37.890 --> 17:40.520
Oyl, you're acting like you got insulted yourself.

363
17:41.530 --> 17:42.530
Mm.

364
17:42.700 --> 17:44.000
This is unacceptable.

365
17:44.790 --> 17:45.790
Mm.

366
17:49.210 --> 17:51.310
How did you end up here?

367
17:52.560 --> 17:54.100
About Madam Waen's project,

368
17:54.430 --> 17:55.710
have you accepted it yet?

369
17:56.500 --> 17:57.500
I already have.

370
17:58.420 --> 18:01.010
Did you know I was the one in charge?

371
18:01.450 --> 18:02.380
I knew.

372
18:02.690 --> 18:03.690
And you still took it?

373
18:04.510 --> 18:06.090
Why shouldn't I?

374
18:06.380 --> 18:08.920
I can work with any architect,

375
18:08.940 --> 18:10.220
and they pay me well, too.

376
18:10.310 --> 18:11.310
What about you?

377
18:11.400 --> 18:13.210
Why did you take it on? Haven't you learned your lesson?

378
18:15.800 --> 18:16.410
Well...

379
18:17.390 --> 18:18.020
Well...

380
18:19.100 --> 18:19.970
They pay me well.

381
18:20.100 --> 18:20.720
Yeah,

382
18:21.390 --> 18:22.390
they pay me well.

383
18:22.960 --> 18:25.070
So it turns out you're all about the money, too.

384
18:26.600 --> 18:28.810
Of course I want money when I work.

385
18:29.120 --> 18:30.450
If not for money,

386
18:30.470 --> 18:31.820
then what for?

387
18:32.510 --> 18:33.690
Well, for me.

388
18:35.220 --> 18:37.960
I thought you wanted to work with me.

389
18:38.130 --> 18:39.670
I bet arguing with other feng shui masters

390
18:39.690 --> 18:41.400
isn't as fun as arguing with me.

391
18:43.870 --> 18:45.510
I don't even need to argue

392
18:45.610 --> 18:47.080
with other feng shui masters.

393
18:49.110 --> 18:50.910
Here you go,

394
18:50.930 --> 18:52.810
spicy pork leg tom yum.

395
18:55.690 --> 18:56.610
Look.

396
18:56.770 --> 18:59.050
Uh... I made chive dumplings.

397
18:59.080 --> 19:00.680
Take some home for your mom too, okay?

398
19:00.700 --> 19:02.110
Oh, alright.

399
19:04.290 --> 19:05.600
Here you go.

400
19:09.000 --> 19:10.790
Come on. Let's eat.

401
19:12.000 --> 19:13.090
Thank you.

402
19:18.910 --> 19:20.450
Come on, let's dig in.

403
19:24.580 --> 19:26.930
You grow quite fast, though.

404
19:35.400 --> 19:37.410
Why don't you go home after you've eaten?

405
19:38.110 --> 19:40.300
I'm waiting for your mom's chive dumplings.

406
19:41.910 --> 19:43.130
Do you like plants?

407
19:43.910 --> 19:44.510
Well...

408
19:45.310 --> 19:46.510
not that much.

409
19:46.740 --> 19:48.090
I just help my mom take care of them.

410
19:50.130 --> 19:52.310
So, do you know all of them?

411
19:53.490 --> 19:54.690
Go ahead, ask me.

412
19:57.810 --> 19:58.520
This one.

413
19:58.890 --> 20:00.180
Crown of thorns.

414
20:00.400 --> 20:01.310
How about this one?

415
20:01.410 --> 20:02.440
Tulip.

416
20:03.010 --> 20:04.020
Tulip?

417
20:05.590 --> 20:07.270
That's a dracaena!

418
20:10.820 --> 20:12.360
And this one?

419
20:14.390 --> 20:16.510
I get not knowing the others,

420
20:16.910 --> 20:18.340
but this one's a golden pothos.

421
20:18.610 --> 20:19.800
You really don't know?

422
20:20.310 --> 20:21.320
I know.

423
20:21.520 --> 20:22.910
I just want to know

424
20:22.930 --> 20:25.700
if it's the same as the one you told me to put on my desk.

425
20:25.810 --> 20:26.810
That's all.

426
20:27.190 --> 20:27.920
It is.

427
20:28.590 --> 20:29.590
Did you put it there yet?

428
20:32.240 --> 20:33.110
Not yet.

429
20:33.520 --> 20:34.400
I knew it.

430
20:34.730 --> 20:37.000
You don't listen to a word I say.

431
20:38.010 --> 20:41.170
It's not that I don't care, but I don't have time to buy it.

432
20:56.060 --> 20:56.810
Here,

433
20:56.910 --> 20:57.690
you can have it.

434
21:00.750 --> 21:01.750
A golden pothos is so easy

435
21:01.770 --> 21:03.530
to take care of, you know?

436
21:03.790 --> 21:06.300
It can grow in both soil and water.

437
21:06.500 --> 21:07.950
If you can't keep it alive,

438
21:08.300 --> 21:10.120
you shouldn't bother trying anything else in this lifetime.

439
21:11.510 --> 21:12.510
I know, I know.

440
21:12.800 --> 21:14.790
I'll take really good care of it.

441
21:14.990 --> 21:16.800
Do I need to tuck it in as well?

442
21:18.500 --> 21:19.610
Does it get cold easily?

443
22:02.960 --> 22:03.810
Hey.

444
22:06.070 --> 22:06.910
Hey!

445
22:11.220 --> 22:12.220
Hey, you!

446
22:15.040 --> 22:16.500
What's wrong with you?!

447
22:18.300 --> 22:21.570
I'm not driving just so you can sleep comfortably.

448
22:21.590 --> 22:23.270
Can't you stay awake with me?

449
22:23.400 --> 22:24.750
Well, I'm bored!

450
22:24.770 --> 22:26.340
What do you want me to do?

451
22:26.360 --> 22:27.960
I can't even drive.

452
22:29.290 --> 22:31.100
But you have a car, don't you?

453
22:35.190 --> 22:36.590
It's someone else's car.

454
22:37.800 --> 22:39.110
I'm just keeping it for them.

455
23:07.120 --> 23:08.900
Did Madam Waen arrange to meet us at the temple?

456
23:09.980 --> 23:10.980
No, she didn't.

457
23:11.490 --> 23:13.090
We still have some time left,

458
23:13.110 --> 23:15.690
so I brought you here to pray first.

459
23:16.920 --> 23:17.920
You brought me?

460
23:18.300 --> 23:19.010
Mm.

461
23:19.410 --> 23:22.900
You were just complaining about having low energy lately.

462
23:22.920 --> 23:24.390
You need to make merit, don't you?

463
23:24.900 --> 23:25.600
Well,

464
23:26.030 --> 23:26.890
we're here now.

465
23:28.290 --> 23:30.130
Since when do you pay attention to what I say?

466
23:32.710 --> 23:33.360
Uh...

467
23:33.730 --> 23:35.100
We still have some time,

468
23:35.130 --> 23:36.620
and it's on the way,

469
23:36.640 --> 23:38.130
so I thought we'd stop by.

470
23:39.010 --> 23:39.910
That's all.

471
23:39.930 --> 23:41.290
Oh...

472
23:41.320 --> 23:42.360
Come on, get out.

473
23:52.590 --> 23:53.590
Here.

474
24:05.900 --> 24:06.530
Come on.

475
24:26.710 --> 24:27.890
What are you looking at?

476
24:28.520 --> 24:30.100
Nothing. Just...

477
24:30.320 --> 24:32.010
You seem really focused.

478
24:33.660 --> 24:34.660
Well...

479
24:34.680 --> 24:36.850
I just hope our project goes smoothly

480
24:36.870 --> 24:39.200
and I don't lose my mind in the process...

481
24:39.560 --> 24:40.260
Okay?

482
24:43.320 --> 24:44.590
I'm just joking.

483
24:44.800 --> 24:48.240
I believe that if you come to pray, you must do it from the heart.

484
24:48.440 --> 24:50.290
You shouldn't rush or anything.

485
24:50.600 --> 24:51.600
Hm...

486
24:51.860 --> 24:54.290
I usually see you relying on feng shui.

487
24:54.720 --> 24:56.490
I didn't think you'd visit temples much.

488
24:57.020 --> 24:59.510
Actually, someone told me that

489
24:59.530 --> 25:00.600
feng shui is about

490
25:00.620 --> 25:02.410
organizing the external environment.

491
25:02.760 --> 25:06.480
But if you don't organize your mind and body well,

492
25:06.620 --> 25:08.690
even if you place the fountain in the right direction,

493
25:08.710 --> 25:10.110
you'll still be hot-tempered.

494
25:10.790 --> 25:11.910
Hm...

495
25:13.530 --> 25:14.880
Who taught you that?

496
25:15.410 --> 25:16.410
That's a good lesson.

497
25:16.950 --> 25:17.700
Dad...

498
25:21.500 --> 25:22.800
Someone, I guess.

499
25:25.240 --> 25:26.490
A long time ago.

500
25:41.400 --> 25:42.610
Let's make a wish first.

501
25:42.640 --> 25:43.710
Alright.

502
25:43.790 --> 25:44.570
Come on.

503
25:50.410 --> 25:52.070
Let's go.

504
25:52.700 --> 25:54.800
Look at you go, little one.

505
25:55.100 --> 25:57.100
Don't get caught like this again, alright?

506
26:03.100 --> 26:04.390
Here you go.

507
26:05.010 --> 26:06.010
I'll hold it for you.

508
26:06.130 --> 26:07.130
Here.

509
26:07.800 --> 26:09.000
Let's see.

510
26:11.200 --> 26:12.490
Whoa!

511
26:12.900 --> 26:14.810
- So many of them. - So many of them!

512
26:17.100 --> 26:18.170
- Oh?! - That one is orange.

513
26:18.190 --> 26:19.700
The orange fish!

514
26:19.790 --> 26:20.930
Must be a salmon.

515
26:25.110 --> 26:26.110
Let me put it here.

516
26:26.600 --> 26:27.670
Okay.

517
26:27.700 --> 26:29.280
I have to throw it far out.

518
26:29.620 --> 26:30.620
Get into position first.

519
26:31.100 --> 26:31.830
Look here.

520
26:31.850 --> 26:33.090
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

521
26:33.600 --> 26:35.520
That didn't go any farther!

522
26:35.960 --> 26:36.810
Come on,

523
26:36.840 --> 26:37.840
look here.

524
26:37.860 --> 26:39.980
- I'll show you how to make it go farther. - Hey!

525
26:40.590 --> 26:41.710
Oh, that's not far either.

526
26:43.290 --> 26:44.700
Go, go.

527
26:47.100 --> 26:48.320
There are so many of them.

528
26:53.920 --> 26:54.990
We're out of food now.

529
26:55.210 --> 26:56.410
Do you want more?

530
26:57.480 --> 26:58.480
I'd better get going.

531
27:25.350 --> 27:26.710
Come on, wake up.

532
27:30.750 --> 27:31.710
Hey.

533
27:32.500 --> 27:33.500
Wake up.

534
27:43.210 --> 27:45.990
Can't I sleep a little more?

535
27:48.620 --> 27:49.800
Hey!

536
27:49.820 --> 27:51.110
Wake up!

537
27:59.340 --> 28:00.490
We're here already?

538
28:03.200 --> 28:05.060
Driving's so tiring, huh.

539
28:08.920 --> 28:09.920
Mm...

540
28:10.420 --> 28:11.720
The same room?!

541
28:12.160 --> 28:13.790
Yes, because you only booked one.

542
28:14.830 --> 28:16.230
I have no problem with that.

543
28:17.310 --> 28:18.700
But I do!

544
28:18.890 --> 28:19.370
Huh?

545
28:19.640 --> 28:21.010
So what do you want?

546
28:23.510 --> 28:25.300
Are there really no rooms available?

547
28:25.820 --> 28:28.190
We're completely booked. I truly apologize for the inconvenience.

548
28:28.800 --> 28:29.800
Hey, you.

549
28:29.940 --> 28:31.730
Madam Waen booked this

550
28:31.750 --> 28:33.130
and even paid for it.

551
28:33.260 --> 28:35.420
We're here to work, not on vacation, alright?

552
28:35.440 --> 28:37.100
Just sleep wherever they put you.

553
28:37.950 --> 28:40.210
But I don't want to sleep in the same room as you.

554
28:40.720 --> 28:41.610
What's your problem?

555
28:41.630 --> 28:43.300
We're both women.

556
28:43.320 --> 28:44.610
What are you scared of anyway?

557
28:46.110 --> 28:47.110
Of course I'd be scared.

558
28:47.650 --> 28:49.560
You're a lady-killer.

559
28:52.960 --> 28:54.670
Uh, please go ahead with that.

560
28:54.960 --> 28:55.840
Hey!

561
29:07.530 --> 29:09.120
We have to sleep in the same bed?

562
29:10.310 --> 29:12.110
It's pretty big.

563
29:12.140 --> 29:13.610
I don't mind.

564
29:13.960 --> 29:15.350
But I do mind!

565
29:23.490 --> 29:24.550
Then you take

566
29:24.810 --> 29:25.810
the right side

567
29:26.010 --> 29:27.780
and I'll take the left.

568
29:28.110 --> 29:29.010
That's fine by me.

569
29:29.570 --> 29:31.180
Hurry and catch up when you're done.

570
29:31.200 --> 29:32.400
I'll wait in the car.

571
29:32.430 --> 29:33.800
It's almost time.

572
29:40.600 --> 29:41.600
Ugh...

573
29:41.920 --> 29:43.090
What the heck?!

574
29:43.610 --> 29:45.400
This must be Madam Waen's doing!

575
29:52.760 --> 29:55.690
Hello, Ms. Soul and Feng Shui Master Xinxin.

576
29:55.710 --> 29:57.760
- Hello, Madam Waen. - Hello.

577
29:57.780 --> 29:59.720
How's the room? Is it okay?

578
30:00.510 --> 30:04.310
It's okay, but I thought we'd get a private room.

579
30:04.430 --> 30:05.560
Oh...

580
30:05.580 --> 30:08.680
I thought you wouldn't mind sharing a room since you seem so close.

581
30:08.760 --> 30:11.410
I'm sorry for not asking you first.

582
30:12.510 --> 30:13.970
It's alright, but...

583
30:13.990 --> 30:16.560
if there's a next time, I'd prefer a separate room.

584
30:16.780 --> 30:17.460
Uh...

585
30:17.480 --> 30:20.560
I think we should start before it gets dark.

586
30:21.140 --> 30:22.480
Alright. Let's go.

587
30:22.590 --> 30:24.170
Come on, I'll show you over there.

588
30:24.200 --> 30:25.200
Follow me.

589
30:26.490 --> 30:27.700
Right here, right here.

590
30:28.880 --> 30:30.580
The plot is here

591
30:30.600 --> 30:32.930
and goes all the way there.

592
30:32.950 --> 30:34.150
Whoa.

593
30:34.320 --> 30:35.490
- Alright, alright. - Yes.

594
30:35.520 --> 30:37.360
What do you think of this location?

595
30:37.440 --> 30:38.440
It's really nice.

596
30:38.460 --> 30:39.800
It faces the sea

597
30:39.900 --> 30:41.250
and is backed by mountains.

598
30:41.400 --> 30:44.510
It'll bring prosperity to both your business and your fortune.

599
30:44.600 --> 30:46.580
It's good for your health, too.

600
30:46.600 --> 30:47.770
That's good to hear.

601
30:47.790 --> 30:51.410
But you shouldn't build the house too close to the sea.

602
30:51.500 --> 30:53.210
Strong winds could batter it,

603
30:53.230 --> 30:56.200
and the salty sea air could make you uncomfortable.

604
30:56.400 --> 30:57.400
I see.

605
30:58.510 --> 30:59.920
That's why

606
30:59.940 --> 31:02.120
the house needs to be built some distance from the sea.

607
31:02.180 --> 31:03.560
- Mm, alright. - Hey, you.

608
31:03.600 --> 31:05.700
But not so far away that the breeze can't reach it.

609
31:13.610 --> 31:14.990
There's one more thing, Madam.

610
31:15.010 --> 31:16.000
What is it?

611
31:16.320 --> 31:18.160
No piling is allowed here.

612
31:18.360 --> 31:19.790
Oh...

613
31:19.950 --> 31:21.280
What are you talking about?

614
31:21.980 --> 31:24.520
Build a house without driving piles? Are you out of your mind?!

615
31:24.930 --> 31:26.280
- What were you thinking? - Uh...

616
31:26.370 --> 31:27.910
Hold on, Ms. Soul.

617
31:27.930 --> 31:28.920
Well...

618
31:28.960 --> 31:30.580
Actually, I don't

619
31:30.600 --> 31:33.320
stay here very often. I only come here once in a while.

620
31:33.380 --> 31:35.160
I think it would be alright without piling.

621
31:35.200 --> 31:36.200
I'm afraid not.

622
31:36.220 --> 31:36.900
Uh...

623
31:36.930 --> 31:37.880
Hey,

624
31:37.900 --> 31:39.180
she said it's alright.

625
31:39.200 --> 31:41.300
Do you ever think about her safety?

626
31:42.260 --> 31:42.940
Uh...

627
31:42.960 --> 31:44.790
Hold on, hold on.

628
31:44.810 --> 31:46.910
Shall we wrap it up for today

629
31:46.930 --> 31:48.480
and continue it tomorrow?

630
31:48.540 --> 31:49.660
I'm getting tired,

631
31:49.690 --> 31:51.290
and the sky is getting dark, too.

632
31:51.310 --> 31:52.100
Let's go.

633
31:52.170 --> 31:54.080
Let's go before it rains.

634
31:54.140 --> 31:56.090
- Come on. Right? Come. - A storm is coming.

635
32:00.310 --> 32:01.400
We need to talk

636
32:01.870 --> 32:03.210
when we get back.

637
32:07.800 --> 32:08.800
Ouch!

638
32:09.600 --> 32:10.600
Hey...

639
32:11.210 --> 32:12.280
It hurts!

640
32:12.420 --> 32:13.420
Let go of me!

641
32:14.510 --> 32:15.840
Are you messing with me?

642
32:16.510 --> 32:17.710
What did I do?

643
32:17.730 --> 32:19.220
The pile foundation!

644
32:19.520 --> 32:20.960
I meant it.

645
32:21.520 --> 32:23.400
But that's the main structure of the house.

646
32:23.420 --> 32:25.280
How is it supposed to stand without piling?

647
32:25.300 --> 32:27.000
Do you want it to float in the air?

648
32:27.200 --> 32:28.974
This is the real working world,

649
32:28.989 --> 32:30.080
not a playground

650
32:30.140 --> 32:31.880
for your childish games of revenge!

651
32:32.310 --> 32:34.240
But the client chose to believe a kid like me.

652
32:34.380 --> 32:37.200
Because feng shui masters like you completely ruined my work.

653
32:37.350 --> 32:40.710
I have to keep revising it nonstop because of your careless words!

654
32:40.730 --> 32:42.100
I'm not careless!

655
32:42.780 --> 32:44.400
What if the house collapses?

656
32:44.900 --> 32:46.700
Will you share the responsibility with me?

657
32:47.060 --> 32:49.710
Or are you gonna say it's because I didn't believe you?

658
32:51.390 --> 32:52.810
What kind of person are you?

659
32:52.830 --> 32:54.920
Do you want to look mystical so people worship

660
32:54.940 --> 32:57.040
and bow down to you?

661
32:57.200 --> 32:58.890
You're just a fortune teller,

662
32:58.910 --> 33:00.720
not an engineer or an architect.

663
33:00.910 --> 33:02.980
What would you know about structures?

664
33:03.510 --> 33:05.960
Can you stop sticking your nose in?!

665
33:06.790 --> 33:08.900
Does having a degree

666
33:09.000 --> 33:10.930
give you the right to look down on me?

667
33:11.500 --> 33:14.620
Just because you've got a degree,

668
33:14.640 --> 33:17.510
my words mean nothing to you, right?

669
34:32.610 --> 34:34.100
"I just don't like rain."

670
35:00.800 --> 35:02.040
Xinxin!

671
35:03.330 --> 35:04.520
Xinxin!

672
35:10.070 --> 35:11.510
Xinxin!

673
35:20.600 --> 35:21.700
Xinxin!

674
35:24.490 --> 35:25.610
Xinxin!

675
35:26.420 --> 35:27.680
Xinxin!

676
35:31.390 --> 35:32.880
Xinxin!

677
35:49.920 --> 35:51.310
I'm sorry.

678
35:54.310 --> 35:55.910
It's okay now.

679
35:58.210 --> 35:59.210
I'm sorry.

680
36:49.800 --> 36:51.920
I'm sorry for...

681
36:52.910 --> 36:54.160
being so harsh.

682
36:58.970 --> 37:01.820
Well, you were right, though.

683
37:04.220 --> 37:06.290
I'm just a feng shui master.

684
37:08.200 --> 37:09.810
I only have belief,

685
37:10.990 --> 37:12.400
not knowledge.

686
37:14.510 --> 37:17.130
I didn't mean it that way.

687
37:17.150 --> 37:18.400
I just...

688
37:18.830 --> 37:22.000
I just didn't want you to interfere with my project,

689
37:23.210 --> 37:26.220
but I forgot that it's your job, too.

690
37:29.920 --> 37:31.240
I'm sorry.

691
37:33.110 --> 37:34.000
Mm.

692
37:34.320 --> 37:35.840
I'm...

693
37:36.700 --> 37:38.320
sorry, too.

694
37:40.410 --> 37:43.040
I'm sorry for focusing only on my own work

695
37:45.700 --> 37:48.590
without caring how it affected you.

696
37:56.420 --> 37:57.550
Well,

697
37:57.570 --> 37:59.700
we still have to work together after all.

698
38:01.020 --> 38:02.020
I will

699
38:02.120 --> 38:05.210
handle the structural work,

700
38:06.300 --> 38:07.490
and you can just

701
38:07.920 --> 38:09.800
focus on the feng shui like before.

702
38:10.320 --> 38:11.160
Is that alright with you?

703
38:13.120 --> 38:14.210
I...

704
38:15.510 --> 38:17.310
wouldn't dare boss you around.

705
38:20.310 --> 38:22.280
You don't have to tell me what to do.

706
38:22.700 --> 38:24.610
Just remind me, that's all.

707
38:51.110 --> 38:52.610
I want to ask you something.

708
38:53.800 --> 38:54.800
Why...

709
38:55.800 --> 38:58.100
are you so scared of rain?

710
39:04.000 --> 39:06.420
It's alright if you don't want to talk about it.

711
39:14.400 --> 39:15.210
I...

712
39:16.510 --> 39:19.510
once waited for my dad to pick me up from school.

713
39:59.480 --> 40:00.840
I waited until it started raining,

714
40:03.000 --> 40:04.310
but he didn't show up.

715
40:12.710 --> 40:14.240
By the time Mom came to pick me up,

716
40:18.720 --> 40:21.160
I was already asleep there.

717
40:23.900 --> 40:25.390
After that...

718
40:28.390 --> 40:30.920
I never waited for that man again.

719
40:35.100 --> 40:36.890
That's why you're so scared of rain.

720
40:40.200 --> 40:42.040
Every time it rains,

721
40:46.030 --> 40:48.300
it reminds me of that day.

722
40:50.610 --> 40:52.500
I was scared,

723
40:53.720 --> 40:55.010
cold,

724
40:56.010 --> 40:57.500
and lonely.

725
41:01.620 --> 41:05.110
Maybe it's not the rain.

726
41:07.090 --> 41:09.720
Maybe it's the fear

727
41:10.610 --> 41:13.280
of having nothing to protect you.

728
41:20.570 --> 41:22.200
You may be right.

729
41:25.720 --> 41:28.800
I guess I have to keep finding shelter from rain like this.

730
41:32.720 --> 41:34.920
Things won't stay that way forever, you know.

731
41:36.110 --> 41:37.390
One day,

732
41:37.510 --> 41:39.710
you'll find your own umbrella, Xinxin.

733
41:40.930 --> 41:43.310
No matter how hard it rains,

734
41:46.120 --> 41:47.790
you won't need to find shelter.

735
41:55.390 --> 41:57.600
It's not because the rain has gone away,

736
41:59.450 --> 42:00.800
but because you...

737
42:02.020 --> 42:03.680
won't be scared of it anymore.

738
42:26.320 --> 42:27.210
Xinxin.

739
42:29.930 --> 42:30.990
Are you asleep yet?

740
42:32.900 --> 42:34.080
Not yet.

741
42:37.690 --> 42:38.990
Can I ask you something?

742
42:41.080 --> 42:42.080
What is it?

743
42:44.390 --> 42:46.440
When will you call me like that again?

744
42:49.480 --> 42:50.210
Well...

745
42:51.200 --> 42:53.100
I don't need to

746
42:53.120 --> 42:54.610
since we're just coworkers.

747
42:56.190 --> 42:58.640
But you said it the other day.

748
43:01.390 --> 43:01.980
Well...

749
43:02.910 --> 43:05.090
that was because the moms were with us.

750
43:06.610 --> 43:07.520
Okay.

751
43:08.100 --> 43:09.020
That's fine.

752
43:10.740 --> 43:12.080
It's okay if you don't.

753
43:29.930 --> 43:31.010
Are you asleep yet?

754
43:32.200 --> 43:34.690
Yeah, I'm gonna sleep now.

755
43:42.800 --> 43:43.800
Sweet dreams.

756
44:11.310 --> 44:13.110
You used to tell me...

757
44:13.360 --> 44:16.680
love will find its way to me before I even realize it, right?

758
44:16.910 --> 44:18.160
I think...

759
44:18.510 --> 44:19.920
it's getting closer.

760
44:22.400 --> 44:23.920
You really don't realize

761
44:24.190 --> 44:25.560
I'm into you?

762
44:25.810 --> 44:27.040
I know.

763
44:27.560 --> 44:29.110
You're so obvious.

764
44:29.290 --> 44:31.080
You two are a couple, right?

765
44:31.100 --> 44:32.100
We are.

766
44:52.700 --> 44:53.880
Hey, what is it?!

767
44:53.960 --> 44:54.720
A snake!

768
44:54.740 --> 44:55.670
- Snake?! - Snake!

769
44:55.690 --> 44:57.080
It bit me!

770
45:01.920 --> 45:03.200
A green one, too.

771
45:05.390 --> 45:07.040
Is it a green pit viper?

772
45:07.330 --> 45:08.440
I guess not.

773
45:08.900 --> 45:10.230
Not a green pit viper?

774
45:10.250 --> 45:11.690
Not a snake.

775
45:11.720 --> 45:12.680
Open your eyes.

776
45:19.620 --> 45:20.810
Are you scared of snakes?

777
45:21.400 --> 45:23.300
Who wouldn't be?

778
45:25.760 --> 45:26.850
Let's go.

779
45:26.870 --> 45:28.490
It's so overgrown around here.

780
45:29.130 --> 45:29.750
Mm.

781
45:29.910 --> 45:30.910
Alright.

782
45:32.610 --> 45:33.720
I'm coming with you.
